            "description": "Realtime consultation chat.\n\n### Client -> Server Events\n\n**1. Send Message**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"chat.message\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"message\": \"Hello Doctor\",\n    \"message_type\": \"text\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**2. Typing Indicators**\n```json\n{ \"event\": \"typing.start\" }\n{ \"event\": \"typing.stop\" }\n```\n\n**3. Mark Message as Read**\n```json\n{\n  \"event\": \"message.read\",\n  \"data\": { \"message_id\": 123 }\n}\n```\n\n**4. Consultation Lifecycle (Doctor Only)**\n```json\n{ \"event\": \"consultation.start\" }\n{ \"event\": \"consultation.end\" }\n```\n\n### Server -> Client Events\n\n* `chat.message`: New message received\n* `typing.status`: Someone is typing (`is_typing: true/false`)\n* `message.read`: Confirmation that a message was read\n* `consultation.started`: The doctor has officially started the session\n* `consultation.completed`: The doctor has ended the session"
